---
import { ISSUES_URL, NEW_PROJECT_URL, REPO_URL } from "../lib/links";
import GitHubIcon from "./GitHubIcon.astro";
---

<section class="border-t border-line bg-raised px-4 py-28 md:py-44">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col items-center text-center">
    <p data-scramble class="label text-faint">05 / Open source</p>
    <h2 data-split class="mt-6 max-w-[12ch] font-display text-h2 font-medium text-balance">Open source, MIT-licensed</h2>
    <p data-fade class="mt-8 max-w-md text-muted">
      Every line of code and every design decision is public. Use it, fork it, host it yourself.
    </p>

    <ol data-stagger class="mt-16 grid w-full gap-px border border-line bg-line text-left md:grid-cols-3">
      <li class="bg-raised p-6">
        <span class="label text-signal">A</span>
        <p class="mt-6">
          Try it on your machine and <a href={ISSUES_URL} class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-signal">report</a>
          anything that cuts wrong or is confusing.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-raised p-6">
        <span class="label text-signal">B</span>
        <p class="mt-6">Add your router to the machine presets, with a source for every value.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-raised p-6">
        <span class="label text-signal">C</span>
        <p class="mt-6">
          Read and discuss the product requirements and architecture decisions on
          <a href={REPO_URL} class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-signal">GitHub</a>.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div data-fade class="mt-12 flex w-full flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:w-auto sm:flex-row">
      <a
        href={NEW_PROJECT_URL}
        class="flex items-center justify-between gap-6 bg-accent px-5 py-3.5 font-medium text-accent-fg transition-[gap] duration-300 ease-out-expo hover:gap-10"
        >Start a project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
      >
      <a href={REPO_URL} class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-line px-5 py-3.5 transition-colors hover:border-fg"
        ><GitHubIcon />View on GitHub</a
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
